<title>USA: Sioux City hogs mixed - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs mixed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher; over 300 lbs 1.00 lower. Trade moderately active. Top $61.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     61.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     60.50-61.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     58.50-60.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows:  all weights 0.50 to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs	48.50</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	50.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	51.00</p>
</text>
